      "x": 235,
      "y": 1472,
      "width": 1830,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "Visual thesis: Rorca is not a prompt box. It is a shared control plane where skills, MCP tools, the dashboard, CLI/TUI, and Pi create reviewable specs.\nThose specs execute one story at a time and compound into memory + graph context.",
